<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs $0.50-1.00 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs $0.50-1.00 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.50-1.00 lower. Demand moderate to light. Top $55.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>- USDA</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs. 54.50-55.00, some 55.50, few late 54.00</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs. 53.50-54.50</p>
<p>Sows: Weak to mostly 1.00, instances 2.00 lower. Top 47.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-400 lbs. 40.00-43.00</p>
<p>	  400-500 lbs. 42.00-45.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 lbs. 44.00-46.50</p>
<p>   few over 600 lbs. 46.00-47.00</p>
</text>
